commit e92213d2f4cbe89355ab7eac1d2498b60b43da38
Author: 仓鼠王 <yjianbin419@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 23 02:24:41 2026 +0800

    test(frontend): pin the English caveat too, after measuring that it reaches the screen (ORD-0226 follow-up ①)
    
    resolveLocale falls through to navigator.language, so a non-Chinese browser renders the English
    sentence with nothing stored -- measured on both arms, not argued. Both literals are now frozen and
    each has its own node; every arm additionally runs the other language's node under the same mutant so
    the two pins are proven independent rather than sharing one judge.
    
    Adds playwright.deployed-bundle.config.ts, which previews the deployed artifact instead of building
    the working tree, so a gate can report the generation the phone actually gets.

